3	 *
4	 * The invariant under test is "zoom never invents pixels" (see the domain model):
5	 * 100% means fit-to-viewport, so the ceiling is a property of the individual
6	 * image rather than a fixed percentage. These are the pure calculations; the
7	 * component test drives the resulting button states.
8	 */
